 "sentences": [
  "Consistency is key in our team, and I want you to get used to these practices from the very beginning.",
  "It's a simple rule, but it helps us maintain uniformity and makes our code easier to read and understand.",
  "Taking regular breaks is crucial for maintaining productivity and preventing burnout.",
  "Our brains need time to recharge, especially during mentally demanding tasks.",
  "Sometimes, all we need is a little change of scenery or a brief pause to gain new insights or solutions to the challenges we're facing.",
  "I want to ensure consistency and readability in our code.",
  "Going forward, I need you to update your Python coding style.",
  "When naming attributes, always end the name with '_r'.",
  "This change will help us maintain a clear distinction and improve code comprehension.",
  "Additionally, when naming methods, I'd like you to start the name with a specific prefix.",
  "Begin the name with 'n_'.",
  "This prefix will help us quickly identify methods and maintain a consistent naming convention.",
  "Not for now.",
  "Remember that these instructions are crucial for maintaining code consistency and readability.",
  "If you have any questions or concerns as you work, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Absolutely.",
  "From now on, I want you to start method names with the prefix 'a_' to indicate that these methods are related to actions or operations.",
  "This will enhance the readability and understandability of your code for your colleagues and future reference."
 ],
